{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a hard game.</strong><br><br>With nothing but your pogo stick to rely on, your goal is simple: reach the top - where the beyond awaits.<br><br>The controls are simple: mouse to tilt, space to jump. Controllers supported.<br><br>Don't be fooled by the simplicity. Between trampolines, swings, and massive leaps, every bounce is a test of precision and patience.<br><br>You'll fall. A lot. And when you do, there are no checkpoints waiting to comfort you.<br><br>Just you, your pogo stick, and a long way up.<br><br>This game is not for the faint of heart - it's for those willing to climb, fall, and climb again.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984960?t=1757577550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984960?t=1757577550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984960/ac201777e6a955fdf6da788a5295b71ba5762c9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757577550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984960/ac201777e6a955fdf6da788a5295b71ba5762c9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757577550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a hard game.</strong><br><br>With nothing but your pogo stick to rely on, your goal is simple: reach the top - where the beyond awaits.<br><br>The controls are simple: mouse to tilt, space to jump. Controllers supported.<br><br>Don't be fooled by the simplicity. Betw